sequenceDiagram
    participant M as NMS / manager<br/>(listens UDP 162)
    participant A as Router / agent<br/>(listens UDP 161) + MIB
    M->>A: GetRequest  OID 1.3.6.1.2.1.1.5.0 (sysName)  → :161
    A-->>M: Response  sysName = "csr1"
    M->>A: SetRequest  (write a MIB object)  → :161
    A-->>M: Response
    rect rgb(253, 232, 232)
    A-)M: Trap  linkDown  → :162   (unconfirmed, no reply)
    end
    rect rgb(227, 246, 238)
    A->>M: InformRequest  → :162   (confirmed)
    M-->>A: Response (ack, else agent resends)
    end
    Note over M,A: Polling = manager asks the agent on UDP 161.<br/>Notifications = agent pushes to the manager on UDP 162.<br/>v1 / v2c = community string in cleartext.<br/>v3 = users + noAuthNoPriv / authNoPriv / authPriv.
